spike/
# .claude/ is excluded EXCEPT the four test inputs (the complete set — grep
# test/ for ".claude/" when changing this): agent-worktree-gate.test.ts imports
# hooks/ and reads agents/*.md tool grants; guardrails-slice.test.ts reads
# guardrails.md + hooks/session-start-guardrails.sh (its skip-gate checks the
# .claude DIR, so a partial tree makes it fail loudly by design);
# session-start-ceremony-findings.test.ts reads settings.json to prove the
# hook is still REGISTERED. The L-20/#130 vendored-file-outside-copy-path
# class. Note the corollary of the partial tree: a `.claude` DIR presence gate
# does NOT skip inside the image, so a test whose input is a .claude FILE must
# have that file carved out here — gating it on the file itself would go inert
# exactly when the file's contents regress.
.claude/*
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/guardrails.md
!.claude/settings.json
*.md
.env
agents.yaml
